(Siem Reap): The Siem Reap Provincial Election Commission (CEC) on June 5, 2024, held a meeting to review the work of the 5th legislative election of the 2024 senators and the election of the 4th, 4th, 2024 provincial councils. At the Siem Reap Provincial Hall.
