It should be noted that in Siem Reap, there are 4 political parties participating in the 5th Mandate Senate Election, and in the 4th Mandate Provincial Council Election, there were 5 political parties participating: the Cambodian People's Party, the Khmer Will Party, and the Khmer Rouge Party. National Forces, Khmer United National Party and FUNCINPEC, which acted independently, neutrally, fairly, transparently, without violence and intimidation in accordance with the principles of democracy.
