The Ambassador said that Samdech Techo is a good friend, a true friend of Indonesia, who has contributed to the historic relationship, especially in cooperation within the ASEAN framework. The Ambassador also congratulated Cambodia on its success as chair of ASEAN in 2022 and the continuation of Indonesia's chairmanship of ASEAN, building on Cambodia's achievements in 2023.
In response, Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that the new Royal Government led by Samdech Hun Sen Prime Minister Hun Manet will continue to work with the Ambassador to strengthen cooperation in all fields.
In return for its gratitude to Indonesia, Cambodia has set up two streets, Sukano Street and Ali Alatas Street, where Indonesian dignitaries have joined Cambodia, especially Ali Alatas, who has helped find a peaceful solution to the country. Cambodia.
For cooperation and investment, Samdech Techo, President of the Senate, recommended that:
