Ms. Don Samnang has been involved in political life with the opposition party for many years until she gained the trust of the party to hold the position of Second Vice President of the Candlelight Party in the model commune of Thmor Puok district, Banteay Meanchey province. Ms. Don Samnang hopes that political activities with the opposition will have the opportunity to help society in accordance with her will.
But doing politics with the opposition for many years has not contributed to the building of society. On the contrary, the party always has internal problems, divisions in the leadership. All these problems made Don Samnang despair of living with the Candlelight Party and decided to leave.
Along with the decision to leave the opposition party that she used to live with, Ms. Don Samnang also decided to join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party. Ms. Don Samnang stated that she now clearly sees the leadership of the Cambodian People's Party, which has a strong unity, especially a clear policy to lead the nation towards progress.
Ms. Don Samnang respectfully asked for the understanding of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, allowing her to live and work with the Cambodian People's Party.
