(Phnom Penh): Mr. Neth Pheaktra, Minister of Information, stated that the Ministry of Information will strive to increase the production of good programs in all forms to be more attractive to educate children to do good deeds and raise people's awareness of the value of Children and about the challenges of children.
This statement was made on the occasion of Minister Net Pheaktra and Ms. Tuy Serey Ratanak Net Pheaktra, Honorary President of the Women's Association for Peace and Development, Ministry of Information Branch, presiding over the closing ceremony of the 2024 Children's Music and Song Festival, Ministry of Information Award this morning. May 27, 2024 at the Ministry of Information.
