(Phnom Penh): Phnom Penh is a developing city in all fields that requires more investors, especially to attract investors from Guangdong Province of China by investing in infrastructure, fish farming and textiles. .
This was stated by Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh during a courtesy call with Mr. Song Fulong, Member of the Standing Committee of the CPC Guangdong Provincial Committee, Secretary of the Guangdong Provincial Discipline Inspection Committee and Director-General of the Inspection Commission. This morning, May 27, 2024, at Phnom Penh Capital Hall.
