Mr. Khuong Sreng added that Phnom Penh, as well as Cambodia as a whole, is a completely peaceful country that can ensure the safety of investors as well as foreign tourists visiting as well as investing in Cambodia.
Mr. Khuong Sreng requested Mr. Song Fullong upon his return to Guangdong to help spread the word to investors in Guangdong to invest in business in Phnom Penh as well as in Cambodia to have more Phnom Penh. Progressive development in all areas.
Mr. Khuong Sreng also stated that in the past, some Chinese textile factories mainly exported finished products to Europe, he wanted to invest in the garment sector when receiving products exported to China, because now the market Europe is also narrow.
In addition, Mr. Song Fulong also invited Mr. Khuong Sreng as well as the Phnom Penh delegation to visit Guangdong Province, especially to major Chinese companies in Guangdong Province to discuss as well as encourage investors to invest in business in Phnom Penh. As well as in Cambodia more.
