* All unit heads, both at the national and sub-national levels, shall prepare a daily work record book for the officers to record all daily performance results.
* In the name of civil servants, they must serve the people with ethics and professionalism, must respect the rules and regulations of the working system, must perform the work according to all the assignments of the head of the unit and must report and ask for intervention when faced with any challenges.
