(Battambang): On May 27, 2024, at the Battambang Provincial Court, the Battambang Provincial Prosecutor's Office held an emergency meeting with the Judicial Police from the 14 Provincial Police Commissions, Inspectors of Municipalities and Districts and from the Command. The Royal Armed Forces of the 14 provinces and cities to discuss, find key measures and set out mechanisms to strictly enforce the case of gangsters.
The meeting was chaired by Mr. Keo Socheat, Prosecutor of the Provincial Court.
At the end of the discussion, the prosecutor summarized the content of the meeting and instructed the judicial police to take active action at the grassroots level, designated as a campaign to address the gang.
