General knowledge: Eating honey has at least 32 benefits
(Phnom Penh): Honey has countless health benefits. Honey is believed to be a cure for many ailments and as an energy food.
Here are 32 health benefits of eating and consuming honey:
4. Boost energy Eating a teaspoon of honey can help provide energy immediately if you are feeling tired or after a workout or exercise.
6. Boosts memory Honey has the benefit of boosting brain power and memory as well. Eating honey can help prevent stress, help you feel calm and refreshed.
7. Help lose weight Did you know that honey is a weight loss drug? Honey has the ability to help burn fat in the body even when you are sleeping. Put a teaspoon of honey in a glass of warm water and drink on an empty stomach or take a teaspoon before going to bed to lose weight without realizing it.
8. Honey helps balance the body and maintain weight. People with joint pain, arthritis, frequent sprains or obesity can also consume honey to help reduce various diseases. The way is to take 3 teaspoons of honey mixed with vinegar and 3 teaspoons of apple juice mixed with 1 glass of pure water, drink every morning after waking up and between meals every day, it will help keep your body healthy. .
9. For those with dry, flaky face, take one egg, beat the red part with a spoonful of honey, stir thoroughly and apply on face, leave on for about 10 minutes, then rinse off with clean water.
13. Exfoliate the skin in an easy way, just take honey mixed with apples, grind together, apply evenly on the face, the roughness of apples can help get rid of old skin cells, change new skin cells to be clear.
17. Relieve itching, mosquito bites The anti-inflammatory properties of honey make it a good choice to reduce itching and eliminate scars.
18. Boosts the immune system because honey is rich in polyphenols, so it has the ability to protect cells from free radical damage. In addition it helps improve heart health as well as protects against cancer.
21. Antioxidants Some special substances that are active anti-toxins obtained from eating honey can protect us from cell damage caused by both internal and external factors. Antioxidants have been found to reduce the risk of stroke, heart attack and some cancers. In addition, it also helps promote eye health.
22. Maintain blood pressure Did you know that high blood pressure is one of the leading causes of heart disease? According to both animal and human studies, honey has been shown to contribute to maintaining normal blood pressure and is a major contributor to the prevention of high blood pressure. Of heart attack and stroke.
23. Lower Cholesterol Honey is a natural remedy that can reduce the bad cholesterol that causes clots in the arteries. When these substances build up too much, they can cause a blockage in the bloodstream, which can lead to a stroke. In addition, cholesterol can cause hardening of the arteries, inflexibility, increase blood pressure, which will increase the risk of heart disease.
25. Get rid of belly fat The antioxidants in lemons help break down fat cells. Honey gives the body energy. All you have to do in the morning is mix 1 teaspoon of honey in a glass of warm water and add fresh lemon juice to stir to eat.
29. Solve digestive problems Lemon honey is very useful in treating digestive problems. You can mix 1 teaspoon of honey and 2 teaspoons of fresh lemon juice in a glass of warm water. Lemon juice, honey effectively increases the production of stomach acid and bile, which facilitates digestion, including the absorption of nutrients. So you will avoid various problems related to the digestive system.
