Brigadier General Hem Vuthy, Commander of the Battambang Provincial Gendarmerie, confirmed that the rotation of the leadership of the forces is normal as well as the leadership of other forces in general.
The Brigadier General, Commander of the Battambang Provincial Gendarmerie, praised and appreciated the former Commander of the Battambang Municipal Police, who worked hard to lead all subordinate officers to perform their duties better and better. Leave a lot of achievements for the unit.
