It should be noted that the incident occurred at 4 pm on May 22, 2024, when a strong gust of wind caused 11 houses in Svay Prey village, Sandek commune to be damaged by opening the zinc and tiling. Of these, three houses were severely damaged by tornadoes, roofs fell to the ground, and eight houses suffered minor damage but did not affect people's lives.
The branch's permanent vice president called on residents to be extra careful when it rains, thunderstorms, especially gusts of wind, to check for safe places to protect themselves from danger to body and life. On the other hand, we have to work hard to increase our livelihood and save money to restore our houses.
