Kampot Governor Introduces 3 Points to Accelerate Systematic Land Survey and Registration
The three main points are:
* First, to prepare the documents of the construction of the card, the documents related to the procedure of issuing the card in accordance with the instructions of the professional officer. * Second: Brothers who own all the plots of land must go to set up their border posts with those who share the border to clearly identify their respective lands. * Third: Please all land owners to avoid border disputes, which is a factor that delays the implementation of land registration.
