The following are the main messages of Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet:
* Samdech Hun Sen Manet stated that today's program is a historic day and an important progress in building the Cambodian social protection system, especially related to the protection of health and well-being of the people.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that the Royal Government of the 7th legislature, human resources is still an important task. Human capital remains the key to nation building and health is an integral part of building human capital.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet only increases the modernization of health services and the people do not get it is worthless.
