* President Hun Manet stated that the official implementation of the "Roadmap to Global Health Coverage in Cambodia" is a proud step forward.
* President Hun Manet stated that "the roadmap to global health coverage in Cambodia" has set out a very clear plan to ensure that no one is left without considering their health problems.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that the "Roadmap to Global Health Coverage in Cambodia" has set three specific goals, including: 1) Expanding the coverage of citizens by the social health care system to 80% of the population. Overall, 2) increase the coverage of essential health services to at least 80 percent, and 3) reduce the amount of out-of-pocket expenses on health care to 35 percent of total health expenditures.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet stated that the price of health services must be increased according to the modernization of services, but must find ways to prevent people's money from going out of their pockets too high.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that the social assistance policy is something that the Royal Government has considered and done for 20 years.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the arrest of the leader of the National Forces Party was due to the distortion of the Royal Government's efforts on the National Social Assistance Program.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that the 4.7 million people who benefited from the national social assistance program were implemented in a transparent manner, not just for factions or relatives, as alleged by Mr. Sun Chanty.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that the implementation of the law against Mr. Sun Chanty is the implementation of legal measures to protect the legitimacy of the Royal Government.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet asks foreign friends not to put pressure on the Royal Government on the implementation of the law, to tell the opposition not to commit illegal acts.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet instructs the authorities and law enforcement forces throughout the country to take the strictest action against gangs.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet recommends the strictest legal action against gangs without exception.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet instructed the authorities to restrict the carrying of samurai swords on children.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet asks the court to strictly enforce the law against gangs.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet calls on young people to adhere to life ethics.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet requested the relevant ministries and institutions with high sense of responsibility to implement this roadmap successfully and effectively.
* Samdech Hun Manet requested the relevant ministries and institutions to continue to prepare detailed action plans and strategic plans, as well as mechanisms for regular monitoring and evaluation of progress and challenges in the implementation of this roadmap as a basis for revising relevant strategies. Appropriate, timely and targeted to achieve good results as planned.
* Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet assigns His Excellency Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Economy and Finance, and Chairman of the National Council for Social Protection, to continue to lead, orient and coordinate the implementation of this roadmap through the mechanism. The subcommittee on global health coverage will be established as set out in the governance mechanism of this roadmap.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet once again commended and highly commended the National Council for Social Protection, the Ministry of Health, the Inter-Ministerial Technical Working Group and the General Secretariat of the National Council for Social Protection for their facilitation in making the "Roadmap Towards Global Health Coverage in Cambodia 2024-2035 ”which is an important guide for the Cambodian nation.
