Authorities order a woman to dismantle a fence post, encroach on National Road 3 and encroach on a neighbor's land in Takeo province's Samrong district
(Takeo): A woman known as a gold trader at Thnal Bot market in Boeung Trang Khang Tbong commune, Samrong district, Takeo province, poured soil on National Road 3 and planted a pole on the plot. Legal ownership, which clearly defines the land as adjacent to the third nation. Despite being detained by South Boeung Trang commune authorities and Samrong district authorities, the woman refused to follow instructions.
Separately, the construction of the pole in front of their land, the head of the Samrong District Cadastral Office, Mr. Hong Lak, confirmed that he had already banned this issue so that the party that planted the pole named Ngao Tong would dismantle it soon.
Mr. Mon Sambath, the owner of the land that was violated by the construction of his plot of land, said that his plot of land with plot number 1337, 25 meters wide and more than 30 meters long, was located in Kampo village, Boeung Trang Khang Tbong commune, Samrong district. Issued a legal title deed since 2015, with the title deed clearly defined by the land next to National Road 3.
But a few days ago, a man named Ngao Tang, a gold trader at Thnal Bot Market, came to plant a stone pillar in front of his land, claiming that the land was bought from someone else. After this person acted in such a violent manner, he complained to the commune authorities and cadastral officers, and commune and cadastral officials, including the deputy governor of Samrong district, came down to mediate and prohibit the construction, but this person still violated.
(Phnom Penh): A car dealer was arrested by the Criminal Police Department on a warrant issued by Mr. Chreung Khmao, a prosecutor with the Phnom Penh Municipal Court, in connection with a case of embezzling more than $ 80,000.
