The President of the Cambodian Cashew Federation is determined to make further efforts to identify priority activities to help develop Cambodia into a cashew empire.
(Kampong Speu): Mr. An Dara, President of the Cambodian Cashew Federation, is highly committed to further efforts to identify priority activities to help develop Cambodia into a cashew emperor in both yield and quality.
On that occasion, Mr. An Dara expressed his excitement and appreciation to the company that overcame all obstacles to establish a company and a cashew processing technical training center to contribute to the implementation of the national policy on cashew 2022-2027 aims to become Cambodia to become a country that produces and supplies cashew products.
In addition, Mr. An Dara stated that he is highly committed to further efforts to identify some priority activities, including:
* 1: Continue to cooperate closely with the relevant ministries and institutions related to cashew nuts to help develop Cambodia into a cashew emperor in both yield and quality in accordance with the recommendations of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, former Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia and jointly help Promote the processing and export of Khmer cashew nuts in response to the Royal Government's national policy on cashew nuts.
* 2: Strengthen cooperation with the public and private sectors, national and international development partners to attract new investment and continue to help existing investment companies to process Cambodian cashew nuts with quality, standard, quantity, supply and competitive with the country. Other cashew processing.
* 3: Continue to cooperate with relevant ministries and institutions and national and international financial institutions, as a whole, to increase working capital to buy cashew nuts from farmers of export processing companies, find important mechanisms to reduce the cost of Produce, process and enhance the potential of Khmer cashew to have long-term successful competition in the world market.
