The meeting was held on May 20, 2024 with the participation of representatives from the Ministry of Land, Infrastructure, Transport and Tourism (MLIT) of Japan, Under Secretary of State for Wastewater, Director General, Deputy Director General, Chairman. Department and professional officers of the General Department of Wastewater Treatment System.
