National Employment Agency announces more than 40,000 job opportunities across Cambodia
(Phnom Penh): The National Employment Agency of the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training has informed the public about 48,604 job opportunities throughout Cambodia, including in 3 major sectors: 35,814 industries. There are 2,780 places, services and 10,010 places for agriculture.
Watch the video of the National Employment Agency: Important remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of presiding over the closing ceremony of the first conference on the future of Cambodia without genocide
Please be informed that the first conference on "Future of Cambodia without Genocide" was announced on May 20, 2024 under the chairmanship of Samdech Prime Minister Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
The following are the main points of Samdech Techo Hun Sen's opportunity to chair the closing ceremony of the first conference on the future of Cambodia without genocide:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech Reak Reay attended the closing ceremony of the conference on Cambodia, where the future is free of genocide.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Yut Techo Hall is an important location to show Cambodia's joint efforts to fight genocide.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the reason for deciding to use the Land Forces Command as a place for the trial of Khmer Rouge leaders was primarily due to the safety of convicted former Khmer Rouge leaders.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this site was previously located in the territory of Kandal province, so it is not in accordance with the agreement with the United Nations, therefore, Samdech decided to sign to cut this land into Phnom Penh.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the lessons for the prevention and fight against genocide are not only for the Cambodian people, but also for the international community.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen fully agrees with the views of the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Hun Sen, who stated that the Cambodian people must unanimously agree on the historical significance of the genocidal regime.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the reality of history is that we really have a genocidal regime.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Khmer Rouge tribunal and the trial of Khmer Rouge leaders were a source of justice for the Cambodian people, and that he and the Cambodian people had been waiting for 43 years.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the verdict of the Khmer Rouge tribunal ended the game of zero and was recognized by the UN Security Council. The sum is zero because the United Nations condemns the atrocities of the Khmer Rouge but also condemns those who overthrew the Khmer Rouge.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asks lawmakers to consider drafting laws to punish those who say Cambodia does not have genocide.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the drafting of this law is not a violation of freedom of expression, but an end to the political game of some politicians.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Vietnamese Liberation Army for its contribution to the overthrow of the Khmer Rouge regime.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the international community for supporting the Khmer Rouge tribunal in seeking justice for the people of Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian people were deeply hurt that the United Nations had given a seat to the Khmer Rouge and punished the Cambodian people who were trying to survive the genocide of the Khmer Rouge regime.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that even more pain the international community not only did not punish the Khmer Rouge, they also helped to form a coalition government for the Khmer Rouge.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in his speech during the peace talks, he pointed out that the appropriate place for the Khmer Rouge was the School of Justice, not the SNC.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen revealed that the Paris peace talks were hampered by the fact that the Khmer Rouge side had maintained its position from beginning to end: prosecuting the Khmer Rouge, preventing the return of the genocidal regime.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he maintained his position of prosecuting the Khmer Rouge from the beginning.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants all countries that support the Khmer Rouge to be brave enough to admit their mistakes.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called the international community that when the Khmer Rouge was strong, no one dared to recognize the Khmer Rouge regime until the Khmer Rouge weakened and then stopped recognizing the Khmer Rouge.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the State of Cambodia controls up to 90% of the land, but the United Nations does not recognize the state administration of the State of Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen raised the question that if the Khmer Rouge participated in the election, there were political parties with seats in the National Assembly, who would dare to prosecute the Khmer Rouge? Thanks to Pol Pot for withdrawing from the Paris Peace Agreement, withdrawing from the election provided the possibility of prosecuting the Khmer Rouge.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in this world, there is not yet a leader of the other side of the conflict coming to the house of the leader of the other side of the conflict. But for Cambodia, it already exists.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech ordered a plane to transport the leaders directly to Samdech's house. The image of the Khmer Rouge leader arriving at Samdech's house is to send a message to the people that the war is over, to send a message to the remaining Khmer Rouge soldiers that the leader has surrendered and to send an international message that they can visit Cambodia because there is no more war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech had already spoken about the history of Cambodia for 48 hours, but only 10 years later was allowed to publish.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen recalled that during his visit to Cambodia, former UN Secretary-General Ban Ki-moon demanded that the Khmer Rouge tribunal try a number of cases, including Samdech Norodom Sihanouk and about six other dignitaries. More. After such remarks, Samdech Techo replied that Samdech Sok Chet allowed the hybrid court to fail but not allow the country to go to war again.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that at that time, if the United Nations continues to force the trial to extend to other leaders, this hybrid tribunal will fail.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen criticized the international community that when the Khmer Rouge was strong, they supported the Khmer Rouge, when the Khmer Rouge was weak, they suppressed it.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he proposed the Khmer Rouge tribunal to try Khmer Rouge leaders.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech could not practice a culture of dialogue with traitorous politicians who attacked Samdech and his family.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that peace in Cambodia has existed for more than 25 years. This peace provides an opportunity for Cambodia to mobilize all resources and efforts to build and develop the nation. Therefore, let us thank peace together and do not let anyone destroy the peace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that at present they do not use a coup d'etat, but they use a color revolution. So if you see a color revolution, you have to get rid of it.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told the forces that political parties that want to make a color revolution must be defeated to protect the people of a country.
