(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Wednesday, the 15th day of the month of Pisak, the year of Rong Chhasak, On May 22, 2024, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, His Excellency Hun Manet, and his wife, Dr. Pech Chanmony Hun Manet, celebrated the Vesak Festival at Preah Moha Sak Moni Chet in Udong Mechey City, Kampong Speu Province.
