Interior Ministry Spokesman: 57 people arrested for criminal and drug offenses on May 17
(Phnom Penh): At least 57 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on May 17, 2024 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News on May 18, 2024.
General Khieu Sopheak added that of the 57 suspects, 47 were arrested in 20 drug cases and 10 were arrested in eight criminal cases.
