Through the Economic Development Cooperation Fund (EDCF Loan) and the Korea International Cooperation Agency (KOICA) project, Dr. sees that the Korea Water Resources Corporation will be able to contribute to the achievement of projects related to water resources management in Cambodia. .
By upgrading the relationship between Cambodia and Korea to a "strategic partnership", Dr. YUN Seog-dae also sees that the Korea Water Resources Corporation has more potential to contribute to the socio-economic development of Cambodia through Bring experience and modern technology systems in water resources management mechanisms to contribute to water resources management in Cambodia.
