(Kampong Speu): Mr. Vy Samnang, Chairman of the Kampong Speu Provincial Committee of the Cambodian People's Party, reminded party officials in Kong Pisey district to continue their efforts to better serve the people in order to gain support. And more confidence will continue to win in the next election, especially the election of the Capital, Provincial, Municipal, District, Khan on May 26, 2024.
He made this remark when he presided over the inauguration ceremony of the CPP building in Kong Pisey district, Kampong Speu province, on the morning of May 18, 2024.
Mr. Vy Samnang said that the Cambodian People's Party has adhered to the Party of the people, depending on the people and for the people, and has strived to build many great achievements for the country over the past 40 years.
On the other hand, the Cambodian People's Party is also a party that adheres to multi-party liberal democracy by participating in all elections, whether directly or indirectly.
